Calling with no key=value pairs, no --remove, and no --append exits 1 with a "nothing to do"
error on stderr.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: nothing to do: provide key=value pairs, --append and/or --remove
